    - `tests/contract_ledger_probes.rs`: `ROW_IDS` and the `stamped … pass` literal;
    - `tests/cli_verify.rs`, `tests/cli_verify/runs.rs` and `tests/cli_verify/stamps.rs`;
    - `crates/viola-e2e/src/harness/run.rs` (`LIVE_PASS`);
    - `crates/viola-e2e/tests/rig_rehearsal.rs` (`rows 26`, `26/26`).

    Leaves hold no figure (`inputs#I3` item 11).
14a. **DONE by hand, UNRUN until the landing: the `cli_verify` summary counts.** Each literal moved by whether Run C
     reaches the new turn in that case, swept by the summaries' sums (testing.md 2026-11-19/20):
     - `tests/cli_verify/runs.rs`: 8/19 · 22/5 · 23/4 · 22/5 · 10/17 · 20/7, and the Stop count 9 → 10;
     - `tests/cli_verify/stamps.rs`: 7/20, and the hook count 39 → 44;
     - `tests/cli_verify.rs`: 26 pass 1 fail.

     No entry has run them. The first that does is the after-landing `bash scripts/agent-run.sh run --integration`
     entry (entry 27); a red there on one of these literals is read against its case's Run C path, never re-counted
     to green.

